  "name": "Glacial Spike",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/svg/daze.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You form a large spike of ice above your head, and launch it at a creature that you can see within range, causing it to shatter across their body. The target must make a Dexterity saving throw. It takes 8d8 + 40 cold damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.</p><p>If this damage reduces a creature to 0 hit points, it is reduced to shards of ice, leaving behind everything it was wearing and carrying. The creature can be restored to life only by means of a true resurrection or a wish spell.</p>",
